{"id": "q0002", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "balanced", "tier": "balanced", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 1165022308, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "0c0eb5f5089b4570f4b5f593318ef7c0c5f8ba06a58bdaf93a6686b9afa1d86e", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.7972545623779297, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 1, "query": "Aiden is making his famous steakhouse-seasoned meatballs for a neighborhood cookout. He adds two tablespoons of his secret steakhouse seasoning for every pound of ground beef he uses. He gets sixteen meatballs from each pound of meat. If he wants to make 80 meatballs for the cookout, how much of his secret seasoning will he need?\n\nShow your work and end with the final numeric answer.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0002.wav", "input_sha256": "fec12bcf750c0246a49dd7730c9816c40f1eb1a4633fc590eb361ac4309c3ce9", "input_samples": 387400, "input_s": 24.212, "n_real_chunks": 25, "score": 0.2892, "act": 0.9984, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "So Aidan is making 8 0 meatballs. He gets 16 meat balls from each pound of ground beef, so he needs 5 pounds of ground beef to make 80 meat balls. And since he adds 2 tablespoons of his secret seasoning for every pound of ground beef, he will need 10 table spoons of season ing for the cookout.", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 24, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 22, "feed_lag_max_ms": 5087, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 51106, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0002_balanced_local.wav", "sha256": "3e69691c0c8170bd37d6eff017f5c8c33a86ae01e87f63eea4bd32eb210ce975", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 20.56}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.119,