{"id": "q0273", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "balanced", "tier": "balanced", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 2125637211, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "0c0eb5f5089b4570f4b5f593318ef7c0c5f8ba06a58bdaf93a6686b9afa1d86e", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.7972545623779297, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 1, "query": "Use the quadratic formula to solve for x in the equation x^2 - 5x + 6 = 0.\n\nA. x = -1 and x = 6\nB. x = 0 and x = 6\nC. x = 1 and x = 2\nD. x = 3 and x = 2\nE. x = 1 and x = 6\nF. x = 3 and x = 4\nG. x = 2.5 and x = -2.4\nH. x = -2 and x = -3\nI. x = 4 and x = 5\n\nAnswer with the correct option letter and its content.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0273.wav", "input_sha256": "43f2555f24d14a3d192a249c6223dac2577b270c435d5d975c6b7169a81ee476", "input_samples": 369200, "input_s": 23.075, "n_real_chunks": 24, "score": 0.4818, "act": 0.9993, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "To solve x squared minus 5x plus 6 equals zero, we factor the quadratic expression. We look for two numbers that multiply to 6 and add to -5. Those numbers are -2 and - 3. So it factors into x minus two times x minus three equal s zero. Setting each factor to zero gives us x equal s two or x equal s three. This matches option C, so the correct answer is C.", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 23, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 21, "feed_lag_max_ms": 6124, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 70549, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0273_balanced_local.wav", "sha256": "00d6752c2b8d254f9f4e0abad6533d1f6b041bec9d3094092b2b09177a51c5d4", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 21.28}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.116, 1