{"id": "q0517", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "balanced", "tier": "balanced", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 717935425, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "0c0eb5f5089b4570f4b5f593318ef7c0c5f8ba06a58bdaf93a6686b9afa1d86e", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.7972545623779297, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 1, "query": "清洁白板的步骤：", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0517.wav", "input_sha256": "11df019a27a65af8e992536d1195d65d332d447e9cd16fa2d639bb62415ca0d3", "input_samples": 24600, "input_s": 1.538, "n_real_chunks": 2, "score": 0.37, "act": 0.9884, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "首先用湿布轻轻擦去白板上的灰尘和干笔迹。然后挤一点专用的白板清洁剂在湿布上，不要太多，以免留下水痕。接着从上往下或者从左到右均匀地擦拭整个白板表面。如果还有顽固笔迹，可以用干净的干布再擦一遍。最后用干净的抹布擦拭一次，确保没有残留的清洁剂。如果是玻璃白板，也可以用一点酒精棉片辅助清洁。记得别让白板太湿，避免留下水渍哦。", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 3, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 32, "feed_lag_max_ms": 7323, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 116144, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0517_balanced_local.wav", "sha256": "4dd5a74dbb52201b971f7d83a3ccb196cae823d8d7f84bc8a2fb481e14900b42", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 32.28}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.117, 1.21, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 1.538, 1.657, 1.752, 1, 0, 0], [2, 0, 2.538, 2.661, 2.758, 1, 0, 0], [3, 0, 3.538, 3.659, 4.782, 0, 24000, 0], [4, 0, 4.537, 4.898, 6.055, 0, 24000, 0], [5, 0, 5.537, 6.173, 7.24, 0, 24000, 0], [6, 0, 6.537, 7.359, 8.526, 0, 24000, 0], [7, 0, 7.537, 8.642, 9.649, 0, 24000, 0], [8, 0, 8.537, 9.764, 10.882, 0, 24000, 0], [9, 0, 9.537, 11.001, 12.169, 0, 24000, 0], [10, 0, 10.537, 12.289, 13.405, 0, 24000, 0], [11, 0, 11.537, 13.523, 14.649, 0, 24000, 0], [12, 0, 12.537, 14.768, 15.892, 0, 2400